Feature: Checkout safeguards

  @negative
  Scenario: A declined card cannot complete the booking
    StepSet Search for a two-night stay
    StepSet Choose the Garden Queen with breakfast
    StepSet Fill in the lead guest details
    When I continue to payment
    And I enter the card number "{data:cards.declined}" in the secure payment form
    And I enter the expiry "12/30", CVV "123" and cardholder "Ada Lovelace" in the secure payment form
    And I validate the card
    And I accept the booking terms
    And I confirm the booking
    Then I should see "Payment declined. Try the demo success card instead."

  @upload @datafolder
  Scenario: Only Markdown or text notes can be attached
    StepSet Search for a two-night stay
    StepSet Choose the Garden Queen with breakfast
    StepSet Fill in the lead guest details
    When I continue to payment
    And I upload the file "fixtures/floor-plan.pdf" as the notes to the hotel
    Then I should see "Choose a Markdown (.md) or text (.txt) file."
    When I upload the file "data/arrival-notes.md" as the notes to the hotel
    Then the notes file "arrival-notes.md" should be listed
